WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:02.601
-Here at "Late Night,"

00:00:02.601 --> 00:00:04.270
every night,
I deliver a monologue

00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:06.873
compromised of jokes written
by a diverse team of writers.

00:00:06.873 --> 00:00:09.642
As a result, a lot of jokes
come across my desk

00:00:09.642 --> 00:00:12.712
that, due to my being
a straight white male,

00:00:12.712 --> 00:00:14.514
would be difficult
for me to deliver,

00:00:14.514 --> 00:00:17.383
but we don't think that should
stop you from enjoying them.

00:00:17.383 --> 00:00:19.485
So we'd like to share them
with you now

00:00:19.485 --> 00:00:22.288
in a segment called
"Jokes Seth Can't Tell."

00:00:22.288 --> 00:00:25.592
♪♪

00:00:25.592 --> 00:00:28.094
These are two of our writers,
Amber and Jenny.

00:00:28.094 --> 00:00:30.263
-I'm black.
-And I'm gay.

00:00:30.263 --> 00:00:32.898
-And we're both women.
-And I'm not.

00:00:32.898 --> 00:00:34.233
So here's how this works.

00:00:34.233 --> 00:00:36.202
I'll read the setups
for these jokes,

00:00:36.202 --> 00:00:38.237
and Amber and Jenny
will read the punch lines.

00:00:38.237 --> 00:00:39.638
Here it goes.

00:00:39.638 --> 00:00:42.475
The Detroit metro area will
hold a new event next month

00:00:42.475 --> 00:00:43.842
called Black Restaurant Week.

00:00:43.842 --> 00:00:46.478
-A black restaurant
is like a white restaurant

00:00:46.478 --> 00:00:48.248
except it's a Popeyes.

00:00:48.248 --> 00:00:50.483
[ Laughter ]

00:00:52.485 --> 00:00:55.054
-According to a recent article,
lesbian couples

00:00:55.054 --> 00:00:57.256
are two and a half times
more likely to get divorced

00:00:57.256 --> 00:00:58.992
than gay male couples.

00:00:58.992 --> 00:01:02.228
-Because it's easier to move out
when you already have a truck.

00:01:02.228 --> 00:01:04.564
[ Laughter ]

00:01:04.564 --> 00:01:06.599
-After failing an inspection,

00:01:06.599 --> 00:01:09.501
a British hospital
is currently on black alert.

00:01:09.501 --> 00:01:10.903
-Also on black alert,

00:01:10.903 --> 00:01:14.473
J.C. Penney any time I'm there.

00:01:14.473 --> 00:01:16.876
-Do you really get followed
around when you shop?

00:01:16.876 --> 00:01:18.644
-I get followed around
everywhere.

00:01:18.644 --> 00:01:20.947
I'm being followed right now.

00:01:20.947 --> 00:01:23.016
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:27.320 --> 00:01:29.121
-Fun!

00:01:29.121 --> 00:01:32.625
The late astronaut Sally Ride
recently became

00:01:32.625 --> 00:01:35.428
the first lesbian to be made
into a LEGO figure.

00:01:35.428 --> 00:01:37.063
-While the rest of lesbians

00:01:37.063 --> 00:01:39.566
will have to settle
for<i> having</i> a LEGO figure.

00:01:41.167 --> 00:01:43.336
-[ Laughs ]

00:01:43.402 --> 00:01:44.704
-[ Laughs ]

00:01:44.704 --> 00:01:47.072
-I didn't know Sally Ride
was a lesbian.

00:01:47.072 --> 00:01:48.941
-Oh, please, Seth.
She was an astronaut.

00:01:48.941 --> 00:01:50.609
Only a lesbian
would work that hard

00:01:50.609 --> 00:01:52.378
to get a job
where you wear coveralls.

00:01:52.378 --> 00:01:54.447
-Okay.

00:01:54.447 --> 00:01:57.616
A black firefighter
was recently awarded $350,000

00:01:57.616 --> 00:01:59.384
in a discrimination suit.

00:01:59.384 --> 00:02:00.953
-Discrimination suit.

00:02:00.953 --> 00:02:04.123
Or, as black people call it,
a hoodie.

00:02:04.123 --> 00:02:05.524
-Amber!

00:02:05.524 --> 00:02:08.595
-Do not wear a discrimination
suit to J.C. Penney.

00:02:08.595 --> 00:02:10.262
-Okay.

00:02:10.262 --> 00:02:11.730
Beijing was recently named

00:02:11.730 --> 00:02:13.599
the world's
least gay-friendly place.

00:02:13.599 --> 00:02:15.768
-While the world's
least lesbian-friendly place

00:02:15.768 --> 00:02:17.737
is Sephora.

00:02:17.737 --> 00:02:18.972
[ Laughter ]

00:02:18.972 --> 00:02:20.506
-A<i> Chicago Tribune</i> report

00:02:20.506 --> 00:02:23.208
found that black residents
pay the most for water.

00:02:23.208 --> 00:02:25.712
-Well, yeah, 'cause you
have to pay for the water

00:02:25.712 --> 00:02:27.480
<i> and</i> the Kool-Aid packet.

00:02:29.315 --> 00:02:31.016
-[ Laughs ]

00:02:31.016 --> 00:02:33.319
-The Disney Channel announced
that it will soon feature

00:02:33.319 --> 00:02:35.021
its first-ever gay story line.

00:02:35.021 --> 00:02:37.023
-While their first
lesbian story line

00:02:37.023 --> 00:02:39.725
was someone owning 101 dogs.

00:02:39.725 --> 00:02:41.094
-Hm.

00:02:41.094 --> 00:02:43.896
Hey, Jenny, why<i> do</i> lesbians
own so many dogs?

00:02:43.896 --> 00:02:45.798
-You need someone
to watch your cats.

00:02:45.798 --> 00:02:46.932
-Okay.

00:02:46.932 --> 00:02:48.501
Wait. All right. Hold on.

00:02:48.501 --> 00:02:50.603
This next joke
seems really specific.

00:02:50.603 --> 00:02:52.738
I don't know if it applies
to either of you.

00:02:52.738 --> 00:02:54.607
-Oh, that's okay.
We brought a friend to help us.

00:02:54.607 --> 00:02:56.409
Come on out!

00:02:56.409 --> 00:02:58.845
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:11.457 --> 00:03:13.826
[ Cheers and applause
continue ]

00:03:20.166 --> 00:03:22.468
[ Cheers and applause
continue ]

00:03:24.804 --> 00:03:27.873
-That is, uh, definitely

00:03:27.873 --> 00:03:30.743
the exact same amount of
applause that you got, Amber.

00:03:30.743 --> 00:03:32.044
-Oh, cool!

00:03:32.044 --> 00:03:33.479
-Thank you so much
for being here.

00:03:33.479 --> 00:03:35.982
-Well, thanks for having me.
-All right. Let's do this.

00:03:35.982 --> 00:03:40.085
According to a recent article,
chardonnay is making a comeback.

00:03:40.085 --> 00:03:43.089
-And they said I wouldn't
be able to create jobs.

00:03:43.089 --> 00:03:44.924
[ Laughter ]

00:03:44.924 --> 00:03:46.192
[ Applause ]

00:03:46.192 --> 00:03:48.627
-That was great.
Here's another one.

00:03:48.627 --> 00:03:51.330
The retractable roof
on Atlanta's NFL stadium

00:03:51.330 --> 00:03:52.932
is not working properly.

00:03:52.932 --> 00:03:56.802
-Oh, well, at least
<i> that</i> ceiling's broken.

00:03:56.802 --> 00:03:58.904
-All right.
Want to try one more?

00:03:58.904 --> 00:04:00.272
-Sure.
-All right.

00:04:00.272 --> 00:04:02.041
According to a recent report,

00:04:02.041 --> 00:04:05.411
koalas may be extinct
by the year 2040.

00:04:05.411 --> 00:04:08.313
-And according to Fox News,
that's my fault.

00:04:08.313 --> 00:04:11.350
-Very. [ Laughs ]
Very well done.

00:04:11.350 --> 00:04:14.020
Very well done.
-Thank you.

00:04:14.020 --> 00:04:15.521
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:15.521 --> 00:04:16.923
-So -- So...

00:04:16.923 --> 00:04:19.024
Seth, why don't you tell one?
-Oh, I couldn't!

00:04:19.024 --> 00:04:20.192
-Oh, come on!

00:04:20.192 --> 00:04:21.794
-Oh, I don't feel like
it'll end well.

00:04:21.794 --> 00:04:23.062
-Just one!
You got to do it!

00:04:23.062 --> 00:04:24.630
-Okay, okay, okay, okay, okay.
-Okay.

00:04:24.630 --> 00:04:26.365
<i> -Playbill</i> magazine reported

00:04:26.365 --> 00:04:29.068
that a new lesbian musical
is coming to Broadway.

00:04:29.068 --> 00:04:30.870
It's called "Clunky Boots."

00:04:30.870 --> 00:04:34.107
-How dare you!
-You told me it would be okay!

00:04:34.107 --> 00:04:35.641
-[ Laughs ]

00:04:35.641 --> 00:04:37.843
You know, really, Seth,
that was pretty terrible.

00:04:37.843 --> 00:04:39.812
-Shame on you, Seth!
-No! No!

00:04:39.812 --> 00:04:43.582
Black women and lesbians and
popular-vote winners are liars!

00:04:43.582 --> 00:04:46.819
♪♪

00:04:46.819 --> 00:04:48.220
We'll be right back

00:04:48.220 --> 00:04:50.757
with Hillary Rodham Clinton,
everybody.

